{title: Dekha Nahi Tujhko Kal Se}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam A R Rahman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Jana jana, [Dm]jana [E]jana.. [Am],        [Am]Dekha nahi hai tujhko kal se,
[Am]Pal pal kate mera mushkil se,        [Am]Aa puchh le jara iss dil se
[Dm]janaa.. [E] ..ana,        [Am]Raho ko tere main takta hu
[Am]ji jike main yaha marta hu,        [Am]Mai pyar bas tujhe karta hu,
[Dm]jana... [E] ..jana,        [Am]Samjhau main kaise iss dil ko
[Dm]jana,Yeh [E]mane naa,        [Am]jana, yeh [Dm]samjhe [E]naa
[Am]Dekha nahi hai tujhko kal se,        [Am]Pal pal kate mera mushkil se
[Am]Aa puchh le jara iss dil se,        [Dm]janaa.. [E] ..ana
[Dm]Ek pal bhi lagta hai [Am]Ek sal jaisa,        [Dm]tere bina o janey [Am]ja
[Dm]Tu sath ho mere [Am]ek sal ek pal,        [Dm]Lagne lagega aa [Am]jana
[Dm]Tu jhuth bhee kehde,        [Am]Hai pyar tujhko
[Dm]Mil jayegee saree [Am]duniya mujhko,        [Dm]Ban gaya hu [E]divana
[Am]Dekha nahi hai tujhko kal se,        [Am]Pal pal kate mera mushkil se
[Am]Aa puchh le jara iss dil se,        [Dm]janaa.. [E] ..ana
[Dm]Tu jo nahi hai to [Am]lagta hai aise,        [Dm]Kuchh bhi nahi hai ye [Am]jahan
[Dm]Milke juda naa ho [Am]ek bar aise,        [Dm]Mujhko meree jan mil [Am]jana
[Dm]Dekhu to mai dekhu [Am]tuzko hi janam,        [Dm]Sochu to mai sochu [Am]tuzko hi janam
[Dm]Mar jaunga [E]tere bina,        [Am]Dekha nahi hai tujhko kal se,
[Am]Pal pal kate mera mushkil se,        [Am]Aa puchh le jara iss dil se
